69623,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-w0p3","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-19T12:01:10Z","updated_at":"2025-08-19T12:01:10Z","body":"> Problem also exists for `PREDELETE`, not only destructor. Corresponding issue for GDScript:\n> \n> * [Calling a class method on NOTIFICATION_PREDELETE will crash the editor #80834](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/80834)\n\nNo. `PREDELETE` works fine in godot-cpp, where the object is not deconstructed so accessing `this` pointer is OK.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3200469623/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3285471628","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109762#issuecomment-3285471628","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109762","id":3285471628,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7D1FGM","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-12T14:17:18Z","updated_at":"2025-09-12T14:19:13Z","body":"Makes sense. I think we can fix this issue by removing script and extension object in predelete (at the end of this if):\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/9b50ea8adec073c891763f7c8c2844bf207cf103/core/object/object.cpp#L257-L260\n\nWe can't do it in the destructor because C++ guarantees that the subclasses destructors are called before the superclass destructors. So destructing script and extension bindings _must_ happen before the destructor.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3285471628/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]